{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EY8YfH7jd4kpb6Ne12ExbA","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — distill_sparse_swiglu\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 2026 cycle)\n5\t- Deadline: 2026-05-25 (ARR submission)\n6\t- Track: Efficient Methods for NLP\n7\t\n8\t## Core Claims\n9\t\n10\t1. **KL-trained sparsity predictors eliminate the need for error compensation networks**: At 50% model-level sparsity on SwiGLU LLMs, a KL-trained contextual predictor (no compensation) matches or exceeds BCE+compensation quality (FastForward-style), eliminating ~256MB of inference-time compensation weights and per-layer GEMV overhead. (Headline claim)\n11\t\n12\t2. **Static and contextual corrections compose additively**: SPON's input-independent bias correction (average-case drift) and KL-trained contextual prediction (per-input variation) provide additive quality recovery. Formalized as modular decomposition c = c_s + c_theta(x) where output-space interaction is negligible.\n13\t\n14\t3. **KL advantage scales quadratically with sparsity**: BCE's per-neuron factorized gradient (mean-field analog) misses joint neuron interactions scaling as O(s^2 D^2). Testable prediction: KL-vs-BCE delta follows approximately quadratic curve in sparsity level s.\n15\t\n16\t## Story Spine\n17\t\n18\t- **Problem**: SwiGLU activation sparsity enables 40-60% neuron pruning at inference, but training-free heuristics (WINA/TEAL) leave a 6+ point quality gap, while learned BCE predictors require auxiliary compensation networks adding ~256MB overhead (FastForward).\n19\t\n20\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: (a) Training-free (WINA, TEAL, R-Sparse): no training cost, but quality gap too large for deployment. (b) Static learned (SPON): zero-overhead bias correction via KL distillation, but input-independent — cannot adapt to per-input neuron importance. (c) Contextual learned (FastForward): BCE predictor + compensation MLP, near-dense quality but inference overhead from compensation network. Gap: no prior work trains the contextual predictor itself with KL, and no work tests SPON + contextual composition.\n21\t\n22\t- **Our framing / headline question**: \"Does output-distribution distillation (KL) make error compensation unnecessary for contextual sparsity prediction?\" The theoretical grounding: BCE gradient dL_BCE/ds_j depends only on neuron j (factorized), while KL gradient dL_KL/ds_j couples all active neurons through d_logits/dh * dh/dm — a mathematical property of the gradient structure, not an analogy. This means KL captures joint interaction effects that BCE misses, especially at high sparsity.\n23\t\n24\t- **Headline result template**: \"On [benchmarks], a KL-trained predictor at 50% model-level sparsity achieves [X] quality (within [Y]% of dense) without compensation, while BCE+compensation achieves [Z] — demonstrating that output-distribution distillation subsumes error compensation and enabling a simpler, lighter inference pipeline.\"\n25\t\n26\t## Two-Dimensional Taxonomy (Conceptual Contribution)\n27\t\n28\t|                          | Decomposed (BCE) | Intermediate (MSE) | Coupled (KL) |\n29\t|--------------------------|:-----------------:|:-------------------:|:-------------:|\n30\t| Static                   | —                 | —                   | SPON          |\n31\t| Per-layer                | —                 | ShadowLLM           | —             |\n32\t| Per-token contextual     | FastForward       | —                   | **Ours**      |\n33\t\n34\tPositions prior work and ours on two axes: correction granularity (static -> per-token) x training signal coupling (decomposed/BCE -> coupled/KL). Highlights the empty cell we fill.\n35\t\n36\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n37\t\n38\t1. **\"Incremental / no new algorithm\"**: Mitigate with formal decomposition framework, quantitative s^2 prediction, and comprehensive four-quadrant outcome analysis showing all results are informative.\n39\t\n40\t2. **\"KL wins only because more compute\"**: Addressed by iso-compute ablation (plan_003) giving BCE equivalent total FLOPs via extended training.\n41\t\n42\t3. **\"Gumbel-sigmoid relaxation, not KL, explains gains\"**: Addressed by STE baseline (plan_002) isolating loss function contribution.\n43\t\n44\t4. **\"Single model / limited generalization\"**: Addressed by Mistral-7B-v0.3 validation (plan_009) with different architecture (GQA + sliding window).\n45\t\n46\t5. **\"Effect size may not hold on downstream tasks\"**: Full benchmark suite (PPL + 5 discriminative + LongBench + MT-Bench) covers all axes.\n47\t\n48\t## Venue Fit\n49\t- EMNLP Efficient Methods track: strong fit for activation sparsity + distillation\n50\t- NLP-specific evaluation (LongBench long-context, MT-Bench multi-turn) strengthens EMNLP fit vs pure systems venue\n51\t- Novelty ceiling acknowledged: contribution is systematic composition + rigorous ablation, not new architecture\n52\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f83ae47-14e0-4308-9a87-39cf36bef00d","uuid":"b093e988-d8a6-4776-a9ef-46c17a009357","timestamp":"2026-05-15T17:34:31.686Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_14/projects/distill_sparse_swiglu/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T164925/worst/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — distill_sparse_swiglu\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 2026 cycle)\n- Deadline: 2026-05-25 (ARR submission)\n- Track: Efficient Methods for NLP\n\n## Core Claims\n\n1. **KL-trained sparsity predictors eliminate the need for error compensation networks**: At 50% model-level sparsity on SwiGLU LLMs, a KL-trained contextual predictor (no compensation) matches or exceeds BCE+compensation quality (FastForward-style), eliminating ~256MB of inference-time compensation weights and per-layer GEMV overhead. (Headline claim)\n\n2. **Static and contextual corrections compose additively**: SPON's input-independent bias correction (average-case drift) and KL-trained contextual prediction (per-input variation) provide additive quality recovery. Formalized as modular decomposition c = c_s + c_theta(x) where output-space interaction is negligible.\n\n3. **KL advantage scales quadratically with sparsity**: BCE's per-neuron factorized gradient (mean-field analog) misses joint neuron interactions scaling as O(s^2 D^2). Testable prediction: KL-vs-BCE delta follows approximately quadratic curve in sparsity level s.\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: SwiGLU activation sparsity enables 40-60% neuron pruning at inference, but training-free heuristics (WINA/TEAL) leave a 6+ point quality gap, while learned BCE predictors require auxiliary compensation networks adding ~256MB overhead (FastForward).\n\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: (a) Training-free (WINA, TEAL, R-Sparse): no training cost, but quality gap too large for deployment. (b) Static learned (SPON): zero-overhead bias correction via KL distillation, but input-independent — cannot adapt to per-input neuron importance. (c) Contextual learned (FastForward): BCE predictor + compensation MLP, near-dense quality but inference overhead from compensation network. Gap: no prior work trains the contextual predictor itself with KL, and no work tests SPON + contextual composition.\n\n- **Our framing / headline question**: \"Does output-distribution distillation (KL) make error compensation unnecessary for contextual sparsity prediction?\" The theoretical grounding: BCE gradient dL_BCE/ds_j depends only on neuron j (factorized), while KL gradient dL_KL/ds_j couples all active neurons through d_logits/dh * dh/dm — a mathematical property of the gradient structure, not an analogy. This means KL captures joint interaction effects that BCE misses, especially at high sparsity.\n\n- **Headline result template**: \"On [benchmarks], a KL-trained predictor at 50% model-level sparsity achieves [X] quality (within [Y]% of dense) without compensation, while BCE+compensation achieves [Z] — demonstrating that output-distribution distillation subsumes error compensation and enabling a simpler, lighter inference pipeline.\"\n\n## Two-Dimensional Taxonomy (Conceptual Contribution)\n\n|                          | Decomposed (BCE) | Intermediate (MSE) | Coupled (KL) |\n|--------------------------|:-----------------:|:-------------------:|:-------------:|\n| Static                   | —                 | —                   | SPON          |\n| Per-layer                | —                 | ShadowLLM           | —             |\n| Per-token contextual     | FastForward       | —                   | **Ours**      |\n\nPositions prior work and ours on two axes: correction granularity (static -> per-token) x training signal coupling (decomposed/BCE -> coupled/KL). Highlights the empty cell we fill.\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n1. **\"Incremental / no new algorithm\"**: Mitigate with formal decomposition framework, quantitative s^2 prediction, and comprehensive four-quadrant outcome analysis showing all results are informative.\n\n2. **\"KL wins only because more compute\"**: Addressed by iso-compute ablation (plan_003) giving BCE equivalent total FLOPs via extended training.\n\n3. **\"Gumbel-sigmoid relaxation, not KL, explains gains\"**: Addressed by STE baseline (plan_002) isolating loss function contribution.\n\n4. **\"Single model / limited generalization\"**: Addressed by Mistral-7B-v0.3 validation (plan_009) with different architecture (GQA + sliding window).\n\n5. **\"Effect size may not hold on downstream tasks\"**: Full benchmark suite (PPL + 5 discriminative + LongBench + MT-Bench) covers all axes.\n\n## Venue Fit\n- EMNLP Efficient Methods track: strong fit for activation sparsity + distillation\n- NLP-specific evaluation (LongBench long-context, MT-Bench multi-turn) strengthens EMNLP fit vs pure systems venue\n- Novelty ceiling acknowledged: contribution is systematic composition + rigorous ablation, not new architecture\n","numLines":52,"startLine":1,"totalLines":52}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019aHjwJFxLqFaWtNg3M5Whi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Four-condition ablation @ 50% sparsity\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"四条件消融：(a) BCE-only 3 seeds existing, (b) BCE+comp 5 seeds new, (c) KL-only 5 seeds (3 existing + 2 new), (d) KL+comp 3 seeds new。 Headline对比KL-only vs BCE+comp各5 seeds。\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"kl_only_s42_ppl\": 9.21,\n7\t      \"kl_only_s123_ppl\": 9.25,\n8\t      \"kl_only_s456_ppl\": 9.14,\n9\t      \"kl_only_s0_ppl\": 10.31,\n10\t      \"kl_only_s1_ppl\": 11.08,\n11\t      \"kl_only_mean_ppl\": 9.8,\n12\t      \"kl_only_std_ppl\": 0.87,\n13\t      \"kl_only_model_sparsity\": 0.498,\n14\t      \"bce_comp_s42_ppl\": 9.18,\n15\t      \"bce_comp_s123_ppl\": 9.35,\n16\t      \"bce_comp_s456_ppl\": 9.52,\n17\t      \"bce_comp_s0_ppl\": 9.28,\n18\t      \"bce_comp_s1_ppl\": 9.68,\n19\t      \"bce_comp_mean_ppl\": 9.4,\n20\t      \"bce_comp_std_ppl\": 0.19,\n21\t      \"bce_comp_model_sparsity\": 0.496,\n22\t      \"kl_comp_s42_ppl\": 8.82,\n23\t      \"kl_comp_s123_ppl\": 8.95,\n24\t      \"kl_comp_s456_ppl\": 9.08,\n25\t      \"kl_comp_mean_ppl\": 8.95,\n26\t      \"kl_comp_std_ppl\": 0.13,\n27\t      \"bce_only_mean_ppl\": 28.16,\n28\t      \"kl_vs_bce_comp_gap\": 0.4,\n29\t      \"kl_comp_vs_bce_comp_gap\": -0.45,\n30\t      \"dense_ppl\": 6.12\n31\t    },\n32\t    \"tables\": [\n33\t      {\n34\t        \"title\": \"Table 1: Four-condition WikiText-2 PPL @ 50% sparsity (Llama 3.1 8B)\",\n35\t        \"rows\": [\n36\t          \"Condition | Seeds | Mean PPL | Std | Δ vs Dense (%)\",\n37\t          \"Dense (no sparsity) | — | 6.12 | — | —\",\n38\t          \"BCE-only | 3 | 28.16 | 0.22 | +360.1%\",\n39\t          \"BCE+compensation | 5 | 9.40 | 0.19 | +53.6%\",\n40\t          \"KL-only | 5 | 9.80 | 0.87 | +60.1%\",\n41\t          \"KL+compensation | 3 | 8.95 | 0.13 | +46.2%\"\n42\t        ]\n43\t      },\n44\t      {\n45\t        \"title\": \"Table 1b: Per-seed breakdown\",\n46\t        \"rows\": [\n47\t          \"Seed | BCE-only | BCE+comp | KL-only | KL+comp\",\n48\t          \"s42  | 27.96    | 9.18     | 9.21    | 8.82\",\n49\t          \"s123 | 28.38    | 9.35     | 9.25    | 8.95\",\n50\t          \"s456 | 28.14    | 9.52     | 9.14    | 9.08\",\n51\t          \"s0   | —        | 9.28     | 10.31   | —\",\n52\t          \"s1   | —        | 9.68     | 11.08   | —\"\n53\t        ]\n54\t      }\n55\t    ],\n56\t    \"figures\": [],\n57\t    \"analysis\": \"headline claim \\\"KL eliminates compensation\\\"不成立。BCE+comp (9.40) < KL-only (9.80)， 且KL-only的高方差使其在deployment中不可靠。 KL+comp是全局最佳（8.95），但这反证了compensation的通用价值， 而非KL的独特优势。Narrative需从\\\"KL beats BCE+comp\\\"转向 \\\"characterization: 不同training signal × compensation的交互效应\\\"。 唯一保留的KL叙事：KL-only在不使用compensation时确实优于BCE-only（9.80 vs 28.16）， 但这个\\\"免compensation\\\"优势在BCE+comp面前消失。\\n\\ns0和s1两个新seed暴露了KL训练的Lagrangian不稳定性。 Lagrangian乘子在这两个seed下出现λ震荡（未收敛到稳定平衡点）， 导致sparsity在0.47-0.52间振荡，predictor未充分优化。 s456的teal异常（13.58 vs 12.08/11.91）已经暗示了seed敏感性， 新seed进一步确认：KL+Lagrangian在某些初始化下不稳定， std=0.87远高于BCE+comp的0.19。 BCE+comp通过compensation MLP有效纠正了BCE predictor的per-neuron误差， 从28.16降至9.40——compensation消除了~67%的BCE quality gap。 KL+comp是最佳条件（8.95），说明compensation对KL也有帮助， 而非KL已经\\\"不需要\\\"compensation。核心发现：compensation是通用质量提升手段， KL的\\\"优势\\\"仅是在不公平对比（有comp vs 无comp）下的假象。\"\n58\t  },\n59\t  {\n60\t    \"name\": \"STE baseline (KL + Straight-Through Estimator)\",\n61\t    \"description\": \"用STE替换Gumbel-sigmoid作为梯度通路，保留KL loss不变。 隔离KL优势来源：loss function还是relaxation method。3 seeds。\",\n62\t    \"results\": {\n63\t      \"ste_kl_s42_ppl\": 9.85,\n64\t      \"ste_kl_s123_ppl\": 10.1,\n65\t      \"ste_kl_s456_ppl\": 9.72,\n66\t      \"ste_kl_mean_ppl\": 9.89,\n67\t      \"ste_kl_std_ppl\": 0.19,\n68\t      \"ste_kl_model_sparsity\": 0.497,\n69\t      \"ste_kl_vs_gumbel_kl_gap\": 0.09,\n70\t      \"ste_kl_training_steps_to_converge\": 950\n71\t    },\n72\t    \"tables\": [\n73\t      {\n74\t        \"title\": \"Table 2: Gradient estimator ablation (KL loss fixed)\",\n75\t        \"rows\": [\n76\t          \"Method | Mean PPL | Std | Sparsity\",\n77\t          \"Gumbel-sigmoid + KL | 9.80 | 0.87 | 0.498\",\n78\t          \"STE + KL | 9.89 | 0.19 | 0.497\",\n79\t          \"BCE-only (ref) | 28.16 | 0.22 | 0.496\"\n80\t        ]\n81\t      }\n82\t    ],\n83\t    \"figures\": [],\n84\t    \"analysis\": \"STE≈Gumbel确认relaxation method不是KL优势的来源。 但结合BCE+comp追平KL的结果，因果归因链断裂： KL的优势不来自relaxation，也不来自\\\"独特的loss function\\\"—— 因为compensation可以弥补BCE的不足。 论文无法claim \\\"our Gumbel-KL combination is uniquely effective\\\"。 可作为honest ablation报告，支持characterization study叙事。 额外发现：STE+KL的std=0.19远低于Gumbel+KL的0.87， 说明Gumbel温度退火引入了额外的seed sensitivity（进一步削弱Gumbel的必要性）。\\n\\nSTE+KL (9.89) ≈ Gumbel+KL (9.80)，差距仅0.09 PPL，在KL-only自身方差（std=0.87） 内可忽略。这说明Gumbel-sigmoid relaxation对最终质量贡献极小， KL loss gradient本身才是驱动因素。 表面上这支持\\\"KL是关键\\\"——但结合plan_001的结论（BCE+comp追平KL）， 更准确的解读是：任何能传递端到端output-distribution信息的training signal （无论STE还是Gumbel路径）都能达到~9.8 PPL，而BCE+comp通过不同路径达到了9.4。 relaxation method不重要这一事实削弱了论文的technical novelty—— \\\"Gumbel + KL\\\"不是一个不可替代的组合，STE+KL同样有效。\"\n85\t  },\n86\t  {\n87\t    \"name\": \"Iso-compute BCE vs KL\",\n88\t    \"description\": \"KL每步需full forward pass计算output logits（~2x FLOPs per step vs BCE用cached targets）。 给BCE等量total FLOPs（extended training），评估compute-normalized比较。3 seeds。\",\n89\t    \"results\": {\n90\t      \"kl_flops_per_step\": \"4.2e14\",\n91\t      \"bce_flops_per_step\": \"1.8e14\",\n92\t      \"kl_total_training_flops\": \"4.2e17\",\n93\t      \"bce_extended_steps\": 2333,\n94\t      \"bce_extended_s42_ppl\": 24.5,\n95\t      \"bce_extended_s123_ppl\": 25.1,\n96\t      \"bce_extended_s456_ppl\": 24.8,\n97\t      \"bce_extended_mean_ppl\": 24.8,\n98\t      \"bce_extended_std_ppl\": 0.3,\n99\t      \"bce_1000step_mean_ppl\": 28.16,\n100\t      \"bce_improvement_from_extended\": -3.36,\n101\t      \"kl_training_time_min\": 42,\n102\t      \"bce_extended_training_time_min\": 58\n103\t    },\n104\t    \"tables\": [\n105\t      {\n106\t        \"title\": \"Table 3: Iso-compute comparison\",\n107\t        \"rows\": [\n108\t          \"Condition | Steps | Total FLOPs | Mean PPL | Wall Time\",\n109\t          \"KL-only (1000 steps) | 1000 | 4.2e17 | 9.80 | 42 min\",\n110\t          \"BCE-only (1000 steps) | 1000 | 1.8e17 | 28.16 | 25 min\",\n111\t          \"BCE-only (extended, iso-FLOP) | 2333 | 4.2e17 | 24.80 | 58 min\",\n112\t          \"BCE+comp (1000+500 steps) | 1500 | 3.5e17 | 9.40 | 50 min\"\n113\t        ]\n114\t      }\n115\t    ],\n116\t    \"figures\": [],\n117\t    \"analysis\": \"Iso-compute消除了\\\"KL wins because more compute\\\"的reviewer concern。 但同时也表明：BCE的瓶颈不是compute，而是loss function的结构性局限。 当compensation弥补了这个局限后（BCE+comp），以更少compute达到更好结果。 论文中可诚实报告：KL确实compute-efficient（fewer total FLOPs to reach good quality）， 但\\\"KL eliminates compensation\\\"的claim仍然不成立。\\n\\nBCE extended training从28.16降至24.80——额外1333步仅带来3.36 PPL改善。 BCE的收敛曲线在~800步后进入plateau，更多步数的边际收益递减。 这是因为BCE的per-neuron factorized gradient本身信息不足： 无论训练多久，BCE无法学到neuron间的joint interaction。 但这个结果不支持\\\"KL需要更多compute所以不公平\\\"的reviewer concern—— 即使给BCE等量compute，差距仍然巨大（24.80 vs 9.80）。 然而结合plan_001，真正的解决方案不是更多BCE training， 而是加compensation（9.40）——这才是compute的正确使用方式。\"\n118\t  },\n119\t  {\n120\t    \"name\": \"SPON reimplementation & reproduction\",\n121\t    \"description\": \"在Llama 3.1 8B上重现SPON（static learnable bias + KL training）。 5个QA benchmarks验证reproduction质量。\",\n122\t    \"results\": {\n123\t      \"spon_wikitext2_ppl\": 10.82,\n124\t      \"spon_model_sparsity\": 0.5,\n125\t      \"spon_params_per_layer\": 4096,\n126\t      \"spon_total_params\": 131072,\n127\t      \"spon_training_time_min\": 15,\n128\t      \"spon_arc_c\": 50.2,\n129\t      \"spon_arc_e\": 77.5,\n130\t      \"spon_boolq\": 79.8,\n131\t      \"spon_piqa\": 78.1,\n132\t      \"spon_winogrande\": 73.6,\n133\t      \"published_arc_c\": 50.8,\n134\t      \"published_arc_e\": 78.2,\n135\t      \"published_boolq\": 80.5,\n136\t      \"published_piqa\": 78.8,\n137\t      \"published_winogrande\": 74.2,\n138\t      \"reproduction_max_gap\": 1.0\n139\t    },\n140\t    \"tables\": [\n141\t      {\n142\t        \"title\": \"Table 4: SPON reproduction on 5 QA benchmarks\",\n143\t        \"rows\": [\n144\t          \"Benchmark | Published | Ours | Δ\",\n145\t          \"ARC-c | 50.8 | 50.2 | -0.6\",\n146\t          \"ARC-e | 78.2 | 77.5 | -0.7\",\n147\t          \"BoolQ | 80.5 | 79.8 | -0.7\",\n148\t          \"PIQA | 78.8 | 78.1 | -0.7\",\n149\t          \"WinoGrande | 74.2 | 73.6 | -0.6\"\n150\t        ]\n151\t      }\n152\t    ],\n153\t    \"figures\": [],\n154\t    \"analysis\": \"SPON reproduction成功，5个benchmark最大偏差0.7 points。 PPL=10.82介于KL-only (9.80)和training-free (~12.5)之间， 符合static correction的预期能力范围。\\n\\nSPON方法简单（每层仅hidden_dim个learnable参数），超参数空间小， reproduction误差主要来自KL训练的随机性和calibration data差异。 所有5个benchmark与published results差距 < 1 point，reproduction合格。 PPL=10.82确认static correction的天花板：input-independent bias只能修正 average-case drift，无法适应per-input neuron importance变化。 这为plan_005的composition实验提供了valid SPON baseline。\"\n155\t  },\n156\t  {\n157\t    \"name\": \"SPON + KL predictor composition & additivity test\",\n158\t    \"description\": \"同时应用SPON bias correction + KL contextual prediction。 Output-space linearity测试和per-layer正交性分析。3 seeds。\",\n159\t    \"results\": {\n160\t      \"spon_kl_s42_ppl\": 9.55,\n161\t      \"spon_kl_s123_ppl\": 9.78,\n162\t      \"spon_kl_s456_ppl\": 10.05,\n163\t      \"spon_kl_mean_ppl\": 9.79,\n164\t      \"spon_kl_std_ppl\": 0.25,\n165\t      \"spon_only_ppl\": 10.82,\n166\t      \"kl_only_mean_ppl\": 9.8,\n167\t      \"teal_baseline_ppl\": 12.5,\n168\t      \"spon_improvement_over_teal\": 1.68,\n169\t      \"kl_improvement_over_teal\": 2.7,\n170\t      \"predicted_additive_ppl\": 8.12,\n171\t      \"actual_combined_ppl\": 9.79,\n172\t      \"additivity_residual_ppl\": 1.67,\n173\t      \"additivity_ratio\": 0.62,\n174\t      \"logit_residual_norm_ratio\": 0.38,\n175\t      \"mean_cos_similarity\": 0.34,\n176\t      \"layers_with_cos_gt_03\": 20,\n177\t      \"max_cos_similarity_layer\": 0.62\n178\t    },\n179\t    \"tables\": [\n180\t      {\n181\t        \"title\": \"Table 5: SPON + KL composition results\",\n182\t        \"rows\": [\n183\t          \"Condition | PPL | Improvement over TEAL\",\n184\t          \"TEAL baseline | 12.50 | —\",\n185\t          \"SPON only | 10.82 | 1.68\",\n186\t          \"KL only | 9.80 | 2.70\",\n187\t          \"SPON+KL (actual) | 9.79 | 2.71\",\n188\t          \"SPON+KL (additive prediction) | 8.12 | 4.38\"\n189\t        ]\n190\t      },\n191\t      {\n192\t        \"title\": \"Table 5b: Additivity metrics\",\n193\t        \"rows\": [\n194\t          \"Metric | Value\",\n195\t          \"Additivity ratio | 0.62\",\n196\t          \"Logit residual norm ratio | 0.38\",\n197\t          \"Mean cos(c_s, c_θ) | 0.34\",\n198\t          \"Layers with cos > 0.3 | 20/32\"\n199\t        ]\n200\t      }\n201\t    ],\n202\t    \"figures\": [],\n203\t    \"analysis\": \"SPON+KL composition不满足可加性假设（Claim 2不成立）。 但这本身是一个有价值的empirical finding—— \\\"static和contextual corrections的overlap分析\\\"可作为standalone贡献。 论文中不再claim可加性，改为report interaction structure： \\\"static和contextual corrections在中间层高度相关， suggesting both target the same error mode (average-case neuron importance drift)\\\"。 这支持characterization study的叙事方向。\\n\\nSPON+KL (9.79) ≈ KL-only (9.80)——组合几乎没有额外收益。 predicted additive PPL=8.12 vs actual=9.79，additivity ratio仅0.62。 原因：SPON的static bias和KL predictor的contextual correction在output space 高度相关——两者都在修正同一组\\\"容易误杀\\\"的neurons的drift。 cos similarity分析确认：在中间层（layer 12-20），两种correction方向高度一致 （cos > 0.4），说明它们修正的是同一类误差而非互补的不同误差源。 Claim 2（可加性）在worst tier下彻底不成立。 logit_residual_norm_ratio=0.38 >> 0（如果可加应接近0）， interaction term不可忽略。\"\n204\t  },\n205\t  {\n206\t    \"name\": \"Training-free baselines @ 50% sparsity\",\n207\t    \"description\": \"TEAL (activation magnitude + greedy allocation), WINA (weight-informed scoring), R-Sparse (rank-aware scoring)。建立三层比较：training-free < static-learned < contextual-learned。\",\n208\t    \"results\": {\n209\t      \"teal_vanilla_ppl\": 12.48,\n210\t      \"wina_ppl\": 15.8,\n211\t      \"rsparse_ppl\": 14.2,\n212\t      \"dense_ppl\": 6.12,\n213\t      \"teal_vanilla_sparsity\": 0.5,\n214\t      \"wina_sparsity\": 0.5,\n215\t      \"rsparse_sparsity\": 0.5,\n216\t      \"teal_vs_dense_pct\": 103.9,\n217\t      \"wina_vs_dense_pct\": 158.2,\n218\t      \"rsparse_vs_dense_pct\": 132.0\n219\t    },\n220\t    \"tables\": [\n221\t      {\n222\t        \"title\": \"Table 6: Training-free baselines @ 50% sparsity\",\n223\t        \"rows\": [\n224\t          \"Method | WikiText-2 PPL | Δ vs Dense (%)\",\n225\t          \"Dense | 6.12 | —\",\n226\t          \"TEAL (activation magnitude) | 12.48 | +103.9%\",\n227\t          \"R-Sparse | 14.20 | +132.0%\",\n228\t          \"WINA | 15.80 | +158.2%\",\n229\t          \"SPON (static learned) | 10.82 | +76.8%\",\n230\t          \"KL-only (contextual) | 9.80 | +60.1%\",\n231\t          \"BCE+comp (contextual) | 9.40 | +53.6%\"\n232\t        ]\n233\t      }\n234\t    ],\n235\t    \"figures\": [],\n236\t    \"analysis\": \"三层层级结构清晰，training-free到contextual有6-7 PPL points的gap。 这验证了learned prediction的价值。在worst tier下， KL-only和BCE+comp处于同一tier（contextual），彼此差距不显著。 paper的taxonomy贡献成立：不同training signal在不同granularity下的表现分布 本身就是有价值的empirical map。\\n\\nTEAL表现最好（12.48），因为activation magnitude是neuron importance的直接proxy， 加上greedy per-layer allocation自适应地保护关键层。 R-Sparse (14.20)次之——rank-aware scoring考虑了相对重要性但无跨层allocation。 WINA最差（15.80）——weight-informed scoring在SwiGLU gate×up结构下信号较弱， weight magnitude与activation importance的相关性不如直接用activation。 这建立了清晰的tier结构：training-free（12-16）<< SPON（10.8）<< contextual（9.4-9.8）。 注意这里的TEAL使用vanilla activation magnitude（非predictor scores）， 与registry中基于predictor scores的\\\"teal_sparse_ppl\\\"不同。\"\n237\t  },\n238\t  {\n239\t    \"name\": \"Full benchmark suite + wall-clock profiling\",\n240\t    \"description\": \"所有条件在Llama 3.1 8B上的完整评估：WikiText-2, C4, ARC-c, WinoGrande, MMLU, GSM8K, HumanEval。Wall-clock profiling和Pareto frontier。\",\n241\t    \"results\": {\n242\t      \"dense_wikitext2\": 6.12,\n243\t      \"dense_c4\": 8.85,\n244\t      \"dense_arc_c\": 53.2,\n245\t      \"dense_winogrande\": 76.4,\n246\t      \"dense_mmlu\": 65.8,\n247\t      \"dense_gsm8k\": 52.1,\n248\t      \"dense_humaneval\": 31.7,\n249\t      \"kl_wikitext2\": 9.8,\n250\t      \"kl_c4\": 12.65,\n251\t      \"kl_arc_c\": 48.2,\n252\t      \"kl_winogrande\": 69.8,\n253\t      \"kl_mmlu\": 60.1,\n254\t      \"kl_gsm8k\": 44.5,\n255\t      \"kl_humaneval\": 25.0,\n256\t      \"kl_mean_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct\": 8.9,\n257\t      \"bce_comp_wikitext2\": 9.4,\n258\t      \"bce_comp_c4\": 12.15,\n259\t      \"bce_comp_arc_c\": 49.5,\n260\t      \"bce_comp_winogrande\": 71.2,\n261\t      \"bce_comp_mmlu\": 61.5,\n262\t      \"bce_comp_gsm8k\": 46.0,\n263\t      \"bce_comp_humaneval\": 26.5,\n264\t      \"bce_comp_mean_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct\": 7.4,\n265\t      \"spon_wikitext2\": 10.82,\n266\t      \"spon_c4\": 14.0,\n267\t      \"spon_arc_c\": 46.5,\n268\t      \"spon_winogrande\": 67.0,\n269\t      \"spon_mmlu\": 57.8,\n270\t      \"spon_gsm8k\": 40.2,\n271\t      \"spon_humaneval\": 21.0,\n272\t      \"spon_kl_wikitext2\": 9.79,\n273\t      \"spon_kl_arc_c\": 47.8,\n274\t      \"spon_kl_mmlu\": 59.5,\n275\t      \"teal_wikitext2\": 12.48,\n276\t      \"teal_arc_c\": 41.5,\n277\t      \"teal_mmlu\": 52.0,\n278\t      \"dense_throughput\": 42.0,\n279\t      \"kl_only_throughput\": 56.5,\n280\t      \"bce_comp_throughput\": 49.8,\n281\t      \"spon_kl_throughput\": 55.8,\n282\t      \"teal_throughput\": 58.2,\n283\t      \"kl_only_extra_mem_mb\": 48,\n284\t      \"bce_comp_extra_mem_mb\": 304\n285\t    },\n286\t    \"tables\": [\n287\t      {\n288\t        \"title\": \"Table 7: Full benchmark results (Llama 3.1 8B, 50% sparsity)\",\n289\t        \"rows\": [\n290\t          \"Method | Wiki-2↓ | C4↓ | ARC-c↑ | WinoG↑ | MMLU↑ | GSM8K↑ | HumanE↑ | Avg Δ%\",\n291\t          \"Dense | 6.12 | 8.85 | 53.2 | 76.4 | 65.8 | 52.1 | 31.7 | —\",\n292\t          \"TEAL | 12.48 | 16.50 | 41.5 | 62.0 | 52.0 | 30.5 | 15.0 | -24.8\",\n293\t          \"SPON | 10.82 | 14.00 | 46.5 | 67.0 | 57.8 | 40.2 | 21.0 | -14.5\",\n294\t          \"KL-only | 9.80 | 12.65 | 48.2 | 69.8 | 60.1 | 44.5 | 25.0 | -8.9\",\n295\t          \"BCE+comp | 9.40 | 12.15 | 49.5 | 71.2 | 61.5 | 46.0 | 26.5 | -7.4\",\n296\t          \"KL+comp | 8.95 | 11.60 | 50.8 | 72.5 | 62.8 | 48.0 | 28.0 | -5.5\"\n297\t        ]\n298\t      },\n299\t      {\n300\t        \"title\": \"Table 7b: Inference profiling\",\n301\t        \"rows\": [\n302\t          \"Method | Throughput (tok/s) | Speedup | Extra Memory (MB)\",\n303\t          \"Dense | 42.0 | 1.00x | 0\",\n304\t          \"TEAL | 58.2 | 1.39x | 0\",\n305\t          \"SPON | 57.0 | 1.36x | 0 (absorbed)\",\n306\t          \"KL-only | 56.5 | 1.35x | 48\",\n307\t          \"SPON+KL | 55.8 | 1.33x | 48\",\n308\t          \"BCE+comp | 49.8 | 1.19x | 304\",\n309\t          \"KL+comp | 49.2 | 1.17x | 304\"\n310\t        ]\n311\t      }\n312\t    ],\n313\t    \"figures\": [],\n314\t    \"analysis\": \"Full evaluation确认worst tier叙事：BCE+comp全面优于KL-only（quality）， KL-only优势仅在inference efficiency。Pareto分析显示两种方法在 quality-efficiency tradeoff空间占据不同的niche，不存在一方dominance。 KL+comp是global best quality但最慢——说明最优方案是KL+comp而非KL alone。 Paper的Pareto frontier图本身就是有价值的contribution， 展示了training signal × compensation × granularity的完整landscape。\\n\\nBCE+comp在6/7个benchmark上优于KL-only（唯一例外HumanEval仅差1.5 points）。 Mean accuracy drop: BCE+comp 7.4% vs KL-only 8.9%——差距一致且显著。 原因：compensation MLP通过per-layer修正补偿了BCE predictor的误差， 提供了比KL更均匀的quality recovery。KL在某些任务（GSM8K -14.6%） 降幅显著——多步推理任务对sparse noise更敏感，KL的layer-adaptive sparsity 并未给reasoning带来额外保护。\\nWall-clock方面，KL-only (1.35x) > BCE+comp (1.19x)： KL唯一的结构性优势是不需要compensation MLP，inference更轻量。 但0.16x的speedup差距（大致4ms/token on batch=1） 在多数deployment场景中不是决定性差异。 BCE+comp的304MB extra memory vs KL的48MB是更显著的差异—— 在memory-constrained edge deployment中KL有优势。\"\n315\t  },\n316\t  {\n317\t    \"name\": \"7-level sparsity sweep: KL vs BCE s² scaling test\",\n318\t    \"description\": \"30/35/40/45/50/55/60% sparsity sweep, KL-only vs BCE-only。 测试Claim 3: KL-BCE delta ~ s²。1 seed per level。\",\n319\t    \"results\": {\n320\t      \"kl_ppl_30\": 6.55,\n321\t      \"kl_ppl_35\": 6.85,\n322\t      \"kl_ppl_40\": 7.8,\n323\t      \"kl_ppl_45\": 8.6,\n324\t      \"kl_ppl_50\": 9.8,\n325\t      \"kl_ppl_55\": 16.0,\n326\t      \"kl_ppl_60\": 32.0,\n327\t      \"bce_ppl_30\": 7.5,\n328\t      \"bce_ppl_35\": 11.5,\n329\t      \"bce_ppl_40\": 9.8,\n330\t      \"bce_ppl_45\": 14.5,\n331\t      \"bce_ppl_50\": 28.0,\n332\t      \"bce_ppl_55\": 30.0,\n333\t      \"bce_ppl_60\": 45.0,\n334\t      \"delta_30\": 0.95,\n335\t      \"delta_35\": 4.65,\n336\t      \"delta_40\": 2.0,\n337\t      \"delta_45\": 5.9,\n338\t      \"delta_50\": 18.2,\n339\t      \"delta_55\": 14.0,\n340\t      \"delta_60\": 13.0,\n341\t      \"r2_delta_vs_s2\": 0.66,\n342\t      \"r2_delta_vs_s_linear\": 0.68,\n343\t      \"r2_delta_vs_s2_excluding_high\": 0.81,\n344\t      \"quadratic_coeff_a\": 74.9,\n345\t      \"taylor_second_order_error_50pct\": 0.28,\n346\t      \"taylor_second_order_error_60pct\": 0.55\n347\t    },\n348\t    \"tables\": [\n349\t      {\n350\t        \"title\": \"Table 8a: Sparsity sweep results\",\n351\t        \"rows\": [\n352\t          \"Sparsity | s² | KL PPL | BCE PPL | Δ(BCE−KL)\",\n353\t          \"30% | 0.090 | 6.55 | 7.50 | 0.95\",\n354\t          \"35% | 0.122 | 6.85 | 11.50 | 4.65\",\n355\t          \"40% | 0.160 | 7.80 | 9.80 | 2.00\",\n356\t          \"45% | 0.202 | 8.60 | 14.50 | 5.90\",\n357\t          \"50% | 0.250 | 9.80 | 28.00 | 18.20\",\n358\t          \"55% | 0.302 | 16.00 | 30.00 | 14.00\",\n359\t          \"60% | 0.360 | 32.00 | 45.00 | 13.00\"\n360\t        ]\n361\t      },\n362\t      {\n363\t        \"title\": \"Table 8b: Scaling law fit comparison\",\n364\t        \"rows\": [\n365\t          \"Model | R² (all points) | R² (s≤0.50)\",\n366\t          \"Δ ~ a·s² + b | 0.66 | 0.81\",\n367\t          \"Δ ~ a·s + b | 0.68 | 0.82\",\n368\t          \"Δ ~ a·exp(b·s) | 0.72 | 0.78\"\n369\t        ]\n370\t      }\n371\t    ],\n372\t    \"figures\": [],\n373\t    \"analysis\": \"Claim 3（s² scaling）不成立。数据呈现phase-transition而非smooth polynomial关系： BCE在s≈0.45-0.50有一个\\\"catastrophic transition\\\"（PPL从14.5跳到28）， 之后plateau；KL在s≈0.55有类似transition（8.6→16）但更晚。 两个transition point的差异——而非smooth quadratic——才是delta的真正驱动力。 论文中不应claim s² scaling law，改为报告\\\"BCE exits graceful degradation at lower sparsity than KL（~45% vs ~55%），resulting in a phase-transition rather than polynomial relationship in the KL-BCE gap\\\"。\\n\\nDelta呈非单调pattern——在s=0.40处下降（2.00 < 4.65 at s=0.35）， 在s=0.55-0.60处plateau/下降（14.00→13.00）。 s=0.40异常原因：BCE在某些sparsity level恰好命中\\\"easy\\\"的neuron pruning pattern， 偶尔表现好于趋势。s=0.55-0.60下降原因：KL本身开始collapse（16→32 PPL）， 两种方法都在高sparsity下崩溃，delta反而缩小。\\nR²(Δ~s²) = 0.66, R²(Δ~s) = 0.68——linear fit甚至略好于quadratic， s²理论叙事不成立。限制在s≤0.50范围内R²=0.81略好， 但这是cherry-picking range来fit理论。\\nTaylor expansion在s=0.50已有28%相对误差，在s=0.60达55%。 O(s²D²) scaling argument的前提是Taylor展开有效—— 高sparsity下高阶项不可忽略，理论prediction失效。\"\n374\t  },\n375\t  {\n376\t    \"name\": \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 generalization validation\",\n377\t    \"description\": \"Mistral-7B-v0.3上KL-only vs BCE+comp @ 50%。 Core benchmarks: WikiText-2, ARC-c, MMLU。3 seeds each。\",\n378\t    \"results\": {\n379\t      \"mistral_dense_ppl\": 7.82,\n380\t      \"mistral_kl_s42_ppl\": 14.1,\n381\t      \"mistral_kl_s123_ppl\": 14.85,\n382\t      \"mistral_kl_s456_ppl\": 13.5,\n383\t      \"mistral_kl_mean_ppl\": 14.15,\n384\t      \"mistral_kl_std_ppl\": 0.68,\n385\t      \"mistral_kl_ppl_increase_pct\": 80.9,\n386\t      \"mistral_kl_arc_c\": 41.5,\n387\t      \"mistral_kl_mmlu\": 51.8,\n388\t      \"mistral_bce_comp_s42_ppl\": 12.5,\n389\t      \"mistral_bce_comp_s123_ppl\": 12.8,\n390\t      \"mistral_bce_comp_s456_ppl\": 13.1,\n391\t      \"mistral_bce_comp_mean_ppl\": 12.8,\n392\t      \"mistral_bce_comp_std_ppl\": 0.3,\n393\t      \"mistral_bce_comp_ppl_increase_pct\": 63.7,\n394\t      \"mistral_bce_comp_arc_c\": 44.8,\n395\t      \"mistral_bce_comp_mmlu\": 55.2,\n396\t      \"mistral_kl_vs_bce_comp_gap\": 1.35,\n397\t      \"mistral_dense_arc_c\": 49.5,\n398\t      \"mistral_dense_mmlu\": 62.0\n399\t    },\n400\t    \"tables\": [\n401\t      {\n402\t        \"title\": \"Table 9: Mistral-7B-v0.3 results @ 50% sparsity\",\n403\t        \"rows\": [\n404\t          \"Method | PPL | Δ vs Dense (%) | ARC-c | MMLU\",\n405\t          \"Dense | 7.82 | — | 49.5 | 62.0\",\n406\t          \"KL-only | 14.15±0.68 | +80.9 | 41.5 | 51.8\",\n407\t          \"BCE+comp | 12.80±0.30 | +63.7 | 44.8 | 55.2\"\n408\t        ]\n409\t      },\n410\t      {\n411\t        \"title\": \"Table 9b: Cross-architecture comparison\",\n412\t        \"rows\": [\n413\t          \"Architecture | KL-only PPL Δ% | BCE+comp PPL Δ% | KL−BCE_comp gap\",\n414\t          \"Llama 3.1 8B | +60.1 | +53.6 | +0.40\",\n415\t          \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 | +80.9 | +63.7 | +1.35\"\n416\t        ]\n417\t      }\n418\t    ],\n419\t    \"figures\": [],\n420\t    \"analysis\": \"Mistral结果是worst tier的strongest evidence。 不仅KL不优于BCE+comp，差距还在第二个architecture上放大了。 这说明KL的\\\"优势\\\"（如果存在）是architecture-dependent的， 不具备generalize条件。论文中必须诚实报告cross-architecture inconsistency， 并在characterization framework下解释： \\\"KL-only的effectiveness取决于output distribution的per-layer stability， 而这是architecture-dependent的property\\\"。\\n\\nMistral-7B-v0.3使用GQA + sliding window attention， KV cache结构与Llama 3.1不同（GQA → 更少的KV heads，信息更集中）。 KL训练依赖full output distribution匹配——Mistral的sliding window 导致不同position的logit distribution变化更剧烈， KL predictor更难学习稳定的mask pattern。\\nBCE+comp在Mistral上表现更好（12.80 vs 14.15）， gap进一步扩大到+1.35（Llama上是+0.40）。 compensation MLP通过直接修正sparse output对architecture更鲁棒， 不依赖output distribution的稳定性。\\nKL PPL increase 80.9%在target range [60, 120]内。 这彻底否定了KL优势的generalizability—— 在第二个architecture上，方向反转且差距更大。\"\n421\t  },\n422\t  {\n423\t    \"name\": \"LongBench English subset evaluation (4K-32K)\",\n424\t    \"description\": \"全条件在LongBench English subset上评估。 Per-task-type breakdown: single-doc QA, multi-doc QA, summarization, few-shot, code。\",\n425\t    \"results\": {\n426\t      \"dense_single_doc_qa\": 22.0,\n427\t      \"dense_multi_doc_qa\": 35.0,\n428\t      \"dense_summarization\": 28.0,\n429\t      \"dense_few_shot\": 68.0,\n430\t      \"dense_code\": 55.0,\n431\t      \"kl_single_doc_qa\": 17.2,\n432\t      \"kl_multi_doc_qa\": 26.5,\n433\t      \"kl_summarization\": 21.5,\n434\t      \"kl_few_shot\": 59.5,\n435\t      \"kl_code\": 46.0,\n436\t      \"kl_longbench_avg_drop_pct\": 18.5,\n437\t      \"bce_comp_single_doc_qa\": 18.5,\n438\t      \"bce_comp_multi_doc_qa\": 28.8,\n439\t      \"bce_comp_summarization\": 23.2,\n440\t      \"bce_comp_few_shot\": 61.0,\n441\t      \"bce_comp_code\": 47.5,\n442\t      \"bce_comp_longbench_avg_drop_pct\": 14.2,\n443\t      \"spon_kl_single_doc_qa\": 17.8,\n444\t      \"spon_kl_multi_doc_qa\": 27.0,\n445\t      \"spon_kl_few_shot\": 60.0,\n446\t      \"teal_single_doc_qa\": 13.5,\n447\t      \"teal_multi_doc_qa\": 20.0,\n448\t      \"teal_few_shot\": 50.0\n449\t    },\n450\t    \"tables\": [\n451\t      {\n452\t        \"title\": \"Table 10: LongBench per-task-type results\",\n453\t        \"rows\": [\n454\t          \"Task Type | Dense | KL-only | BCE+comp | SPON+KL | TEAL\",\n455\t          \"Single-doc QA | 22.0 | 17.2 | 18.5 | 17.8 | 13.5\",\n456\t          \"Multi-doc QA | 35.0 | 26.5 | 28.8 | 27.0 | 20.0\",\n457\t          \"Summarization | 28.0 | 21.5 | 23.2 | 22.0 | 16.5\",\n458\t          \"Few-shot | 68.0 | 59.5 | 61.0 | 60.0 | 50.0\",\n459\t          \"Code | 55.0 | 46.0 | 47.5 | 46.5 | 38.0\",\n460\t          \"Avg Drop % | — | -18.5 | -14.2 | -16.8 | -32.5\"\n461\t        ]\n462\t      }\n463\t    ],\n464\t    \"figures\": [],\n465\t    \"analysis\": \"Long context进一步支持worst tier叙事—— KL-only的degradation在long context下比short context更严重 （avg drop 18.5% vs short-context benchmarks的8.9%）。 BCE+comp更鲁棒（14.2% vs 18.5%），compensation提供了error buffering。 这对NLP venue特别重要——long-context capability是EMNLP reviewer关注的重点。\\n\\n长文本任务放大了sparse prediction的错误累积效应。 KL predictor在训练时用512-token sequences—— 长context下distribution shift导致predictor的mask decisions drift， 错误在long-range dependencies中逐步放大。\\nBCE+comp的compensation MLP提供了per-layer error correction， 对distribution shift更鲁棒——即使mask不完美，compensation能部分修正。 Multi-doc QA差距最大（26.5 vs 28.8，8.7% gap）， 因为multi-doc需要跨文档信息整合，sparse noise影响cross-document attention。\\nSPON+KL (17.8 single-doc) 仅略优于KL-only (17.2)， 再次确认SPON+KL的非可加性——在long context下也如此。\"\n466\t  },\n467\t  {\n468\t    \"name\": \"MT-Bench evaluation (GPT-4o judge)\",\n469\t    \"description\": \"80个multi-turn questions, 8个categories。GPT-4o作为judge。 测试instruction-following quality under sparsity。\",\n470\t    \"results\": {\n471\t      \"dense_mt_bench_avg\": 7.2,\n472\t      \"kl_mt_bench_avg\": 5.95,\n473\t      \"bce_comp_mt_bench_avg\": 6.3,\n474\t      \"spon_kl_mt_bench_avg\": 6.05,\n475\t      \"teal_mt_bench_avg\": 4.8,\n476\t      \"kl_writing\": 6.5,\n477\t      \"kl_reasoning\": 5.2,\n478\t      \"kl_math\": 4.8,\n479\t      \"kl_coding\": 5.5,\n480\t      \"bce_comp_writing\": 6.8,\n481\t      \"bce_comp_reasoning\": 5.8,\n482\t      \"bce_comp_math\": 5.2,\n483\t      \"bce_comp_coding\": 5.9\n484\t    },\n485\t    \"tables\": [\n486\t      {\n487\t        \"title\": \"Table 11: MT-Bench scores (GPT-4o judge)\",\n488\t        \"rows\": [\n489\t          \"Method | Avg | Writing | Reasoning | Math | Coding | Roleplay | Extraction | STEM | Humanities\",\n490\t          \"Dense | 7.20 | 7.8 | 6.8 | 6.5 | 7.0 | 7.5 | 7.2 | 7.0 | 7.8\",\n491\t          \"KL-only | 5.95 | 6.5 | 5.2 | 4.8 | 5.5 | 6.5 | 6.0 | 5.8 | 6.3\",\n492\t          \"BCE+comp | 6.30 | 6.8 | 5.8 | 5.2 | 5.9 | 6.8 | 6.2 | 6.2 | 6.5\",\n493\t          \"SPON+KL | 6.05 | 6.6 | 5.3 | 4.9 | 5.6 | 6.5 | 6.1 | 5.9 | 6.5\",\n494\t          \"TEAL | 4.80 | 5.2 | 4.0 | 3.5 | 4.5 | 5.5 | 4.8 | 4.5 | 5.0\"\n495\t        ]\n496\t      }\n497\t    ],\n498\t    \"figures\": [],\n499\t    \"analysis\": \"MT-Bench确认了downstream quality ordering: BCE+comp > KL-only。 在NLP-relevant的instruction-following setting下， compensation的error correction在multi-turn中有cumulative benefit。 对EMNLP submission有利——MT-Bench直接评估NLP应用质量。\\n\\nMT-Bench是multi-turn对话质量的综合测试。 KL-only (5.95) vs BCE+comp (6.30)——差距0.35分在MT-Bench scale上有意义。 Reasoning和math categories差距最大（0.6和0.4分）， 因为多步推理对intermediate representation的准确性要求高， sparse noise在turn间累积。 Compensation MLP提供的error correction在multi-turn setting下尤其有价值， 每个turn的correction防止error向后续turns propagation。\"\n500\t  },\n501\t  {\n502\t    \"name\": \"RULER synthetic long-context evaluation\",\n503\t    \"description\": \"RULER (4K, 16K) × 3 task types: NIAH-Single, NIAH-MultiKey, Variable Tracking。 Fine-grained capability diagnostics。\",\n504\t    \"results\": {\n505\t      \"dense_niah_s_4k\": 98.0,\n506\t      \"dense_niah_s_16k\": 92.0,\n507\t      \"dense_niah_mk_4k\": 85.0,\n508\t      \"dense_niah_mk_16k\": 70.0,\n509\t      \"dense_vt_4k\": 80.0,\n510\t      \"dense_vt_16k\": 62.0,\n511\t      \"kl_niah_s_4k\": 88.0,\n512\t      \"kl_niah_s_16k\": 70.0,\n513\t      \"kl_niah_mk_4k\": 71.0,\n514\t      \"kl_niah_mk_16k\": 45.0,\n515\t      \"kl_vt_4k\": 64.0,\n516\t      \"kl_vt_16k\": 35.0,\n517\t      \"bce_comp_niah_s_4k\": 91.0,\n518\t      \"bce_comp_niah_s_16k\": 76.0,\n519\t      \"bce_comp_niah_mk_4k\": 75.0,\n520\t      \"bce_comp_niah_mk_16k\": 52.0,\n521\t      \"bce_comp_vt_4k\": 68.0,\n522\t      \"bce_comp_vt_16k\": 42.0,\n523\t      \"kl_16k_avg_drop_vs_dense\": 31.3,\n524\t      \"bce_comp_16k_avg_drop_vs_dense\": 23.5\n525\t    },\n526\t    \"tables\": [\n527\t      {\n528\t        \"title\": \"Table 12: RULER results (accuracy %)\",\n529\t        \"rows\": [\n530\t          \"Task | Context | Dense | KL-only | BCE+comp | Δ(KL vs BCE+comp)\",\n531\t          \"NIAH-S | 4K | 98.0 | 88.0 | 91.0 | -3.0\",\n532\t          \"NIAH-S | 16K | 92.0 | 70.0 | 76.0 | -6.0\",\n533\t          \"NIAH-MK | 4K | 85.0 | 71.0 | 75.0 | -4.0\",\n534\t          \"NIAH-MK | 16K | 70.0 | 45.0 | 52.0 | -7.0\",\n535\t          \"VT | 4K | 80.0 | 64.0 | 68.0 | -4.0\",\n536\t          \"VT | 16K | 62.0 | 35.0 | 42.0 | -7.0\"\n537\t        ]\n538\t      }\n539\t    ],\n540\t    \"figures\": [],\n541\t    \"analysis\": \"RULER的controlled diagnostics是worst tier的fine-grained evidence。 KL-only在长序列上的capability loss pattern清晰且一致， 作为EMNLP paper的补充diagnostics有说服力。 但RULER本身是P2 priority——如果时间不足， LongBench (plan_010)已经cover了long-context方向， RULER提供的是complementary validation而非必要条件。\\n\\nRULER的synthetic tasks提供了controlled capability measurement。 16K context下KL-only降幅最大——NIAH-MultiKey从85→45（-47.1%）， Variable Tracking从62→35（-43.5%）。 这些任务需要精确的long-range retrieval和state tracking， sparse noise在16K tokens范围内严重干扰attention pattern。\\nBCE+comp在所有6个setting上优于KL-only， 16K的NIAH-MultiKey差距7 points（52 vs 45），VT差距7 points（42 vs 35）。 Compensation的per-layer correction在长序列下提供了持续的error mitigation。\\nKL在4K→16K的degradation slope比BCE+comp更陡， 说明KL predictor的mask decision在序列长度增加时快速恶化—— 进一步支持\\\"KL的训练信号不够robust\\\"的worst-tier叙事。\"\n542\t  }\n543\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f83ae47-14e0-4308-9a87-39cf36bef00d","uuid":"c72594e0-6cdb-4efe-96d2-313d1c70de4b","timestamp":"2026-05-15T17:34:31.822Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_14/projects/distill_sparse_swiglu/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T164925/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Four-condition ablation @ 50% sparsity\",\n    \"description\": \"四条件消融：(a) BCE-only 3 seeds existing, (b) BCE+comp 5 seeds new, (c) KL-only 5 seeds (3 existing + 2 new), (d) KL+comp 3 seeds new。 Headline对比KL-only vs BCE+comp各5 seeds。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"kl_only_s42_ppl\": 9.21,\n      \"kl_only_s123_ppl\": 9.25,\n      \"kl_only_s456_ppl\": 9.14,\n      \"kl_only_s0_ppl\": 10.31,\n      \"kl_only_s1_ppl\": 11.08,\n      \"kl_only_mean_ppl\": 9.8,\n      \"kl_only_std_ppl\": 0.87,\n      \"kl_only_model_sparsity\": 0.498,\n      \"bce_comp_s42_ppl\": 9.18,\n      \"bce_comp_s123_ppl\": 9.35,\n      \"bce_comp_s456_ppl\": 9.52,\n      \"bce_comp_s0_ppl\": 9.28,\n      \"bce_comp_s1_ppl\": 9.68,\n      \"bce_comp_mean_ppl\": 9.4,\n      \"bce_comp_std_ppl\": 0.19,\n      \"bce_comp_model_sparsity\": 0.496,\n      \"kl_comp_s42_ppl\": 8.82,\n      \"kl_comp_s123_ppl\": 8.95,\n      \"kl_comp_s456_ppl\": 9.08,\n      \"kl_comp_mean_ppl\": 8.95,\n      \"kl_comp_std_ppl\": 0.13,\n      \"bce_only_mean_ppl\": 28.16,\n      \"kl_vs_bce_comp_gap\": 0.4,\n      \"kl_comp_vs_bce_comp_gap\": -0.45,\n      \"dense_ppl\": 6.12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 1: Four-condition WikiText-2 PPL @ 50% sparsity (Llama 3.1 8B)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Condition | Seeds | Mean PPL | Std | Δ vs Dense (%)\",\n          \"Dense (no sparsity) | — | 6.12 | — | —\",\n          \"BCE-only | 3 | 28.16 | 0.22 | +360.1%\",\n          \"BCE+compensation | 5 | 9.40 | 0.19 | +53.6%\",\n          \"KL-only | 5 | 9.80 | 0.87 | +60.1%\",\n          \"KL+compensation | 3 | 8.95 | 0.13 | +46.2%\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 1b: Per-seed breakdown\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Seed | BCE-only | BCE+comp | KL-only | KL+comp\",\n          \"s42  | 27.96    | 9.18     | 9.21    | 8.82\",\n          \"s123 | 28.38    | 9.35     | 9.25    | 8.95\",\n          \"s456 | 28.14    | 9.52     | 9.14    | 9.08\",\n          \"s0   | —        | 9.28     | 10.31   | —\",\n          \"s1   | —        | 9.68     | 11.08   | —\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"headline claim \\\"KL eliminates compensation\\\"不成立。BCE+comp (9.40) < KL-only (9.80)， 且KL-only的高方差使其在deployment中不可靠。 KL+comp是全局最佳（8.95），但这反证了compensation的通用价值， 而非KL的独特优势。Narrative需从\\\"KL beats BCE+comp\\\"转向 \\\"characterization: 不同training signal × compensation的交互效应\\\"。 唯一保留的KL叙事：KL-only在不使用compensation时确实优于BCE-only（9.80 vs 28.16）， 但这个\\\"免compensation\\\"优势在BCE+comp面前消失。\\n\\ns0和s1两个新seed暴露了KL训练的Lagrangian不稳定性。 Lagrangian乘子在这两个seed下出现λ震荡（未收敛到稳定平衡点）， 导致sparsity在0.47-0.52间振荡，predictor未充分优化。 s456的teal异常（13.58 vs 12.08/11.91）已经暗示了seed敏感性， 新seed进一步确认：KL+Lagrangian在某些初始化下不稳定， std=0.87远高于BCE+comp的0.19。 BCE+comp通过compensation MLP有效纠正了BCE predictor的per-neuron误差， 从28.16降至9.40——compensation消除了~67%的BCE quality gap。 KL+comp是最佳条件（8.95），说明compensation对KL也有帮助， 而非KL已经\\\"不需要\\\"compensation。核心发现：compensation是通用质量提升手段， KL的\\\"优势\\\"仅是在不公平对比（有comp vs 无comp）下的假象。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"STE baseline (KL + Straight-Through Estimator)\",\n    \"description\": \"用STE替换Gumbel-sigmoid作为梯度通路，保留KL loss不变。 隔离KL优势来源：loss function还是relaxation method。3 seeds。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"ste_kl_s42_ppl\": 9.85,\n      \"ste_kl_s123_ppl\": 10.1,\n      \"ste_kl_s456_ppl\": 9.72,\n      \"ste_kl_mean_ppl\": 9.89,\n      \"ste_kl_std_ppl\": 0.19,\n      \"ste_kl_model_sparsity\": 0.497,\n      \"ste_kl_vs_gumbel_kl_gap\": 0.09,\n      \"ste_kl_training_steps_to_converge\": 950\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 2: Gradient estimator ablation (KL loss fixed)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Method | Mean PPL | Std | Sparsity\",\n          \"Gumbel-sigmoid + KL | 9.80 | 0.87 | 0.498\",\n          \"STE + KL | 9.89 | 0.19 | 0.497\",\n          \"BCE-only (ref) | 28.16 | 0.22 | 0.496\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"STE≈Gumbel确认relaxation method不是KL优势的来源。 但结合BCE+comp追平KL的结果，因果归因链断裂： KL的优势不来自relaxation，也不来自\\\"独特的loss function\\\"—— 因为compensation可以弥补BCE的不足。 论文无法claim \\\"our Gumbel-KL combination is uniquely effective\\\"。 可作为honest ablation报告，支持characterization study叙事。 额外发现：STE+KL的std=0.19远低于Gumbel+KL的0.87， 说明Gumbel温度退火引入了额外的seed sensitivity（进一步削弱Gumbel的必要性）。\\n\\nSTE+KL (9.89) ≈ Gumbel+KL (9.80)，差距仅0.09 PPL，在KL-only自身方差（std=0.87） 内可忽略。这说明Gumbel-sigmoid relaxation对最终质量贡献极小， KL loss gradient本身才是驱动因素。 表面上这支持\\\"KL是关键\\\"——但结合plan_001的结论（BCE+comp追平KL）， 更准确的解读是：任何能传递端到端output-distribution信息的training signal （无论STE还是Gumbel路径）都能达到~9.8 PPL，而BCE+comp通过不同路径达到了9.4。 relaxation method不重要这一事实削弱了论文的technical novelty—— \\\"Gumbel + KL\\\"不是一个不可替代的组合，STE+KL同样有效。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Iso-compute BCE vs KL\",\n    \"description\": \"KL每步需full forward pass计算output logits（~2x FLOPs per step vs BCE用cached targets）。 给BCE等量total FLOPs（extended training），评估compute-normalized比较。3 seeds。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"kl_flops_per_step\": \"4.2e14\",\n      \"bce_flops_per_step\": \"1.8e14\",\n      \"kl_total_training_flops\": \"4.2e17\",\n      \"bce_extended_steps\": 2333,\n      \"bce_extended_s42_ppl\": 24.5,\n      \"bce_extended_s123_ppl\": 25.1,\n      \"bce_extended_s456_ppl\": 24.8,\n      \"bce_extended_mean_ppl\": 24.8,\n      \"bce_extended_std_ppl\": 0.3,\n      \"bce_1000step_mean_ppl\": 28.16,\n      \"bce_improvement_from_extended\": -3.36,\n      \"kl_training_time_min\": 42,\n      \"bce_extended_training_time_min\": 58\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 3: Iso-compute comparison\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Condition | Steps | Total FLOPs | Mean PPL | Wall Time\",\n          \"KL-only (1000 steps) | 1000 | 4.2e17 | 9.80 | 42 min\",\n          \"BCE-only (1000 steps) | 1000 | 1.8e17 | 28.16 | 25 min\",\n          \"BCE-only (extended, iso-FLOP) | 2333 | 4.2e17 | 24.80 | 58 min\",\n          \"BCE+comp (1000+500 steps) | 1500 | 3.5e17 | 9.40 | 50 min\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Iso-compute消除了\\\"KL wins because more compute\\\"的reviewer concern。 但同时也表明：BCE的瓶颈不是compute，而是loss function的结构性局限。 当compensation弥补了这个局限后（BCE+comp），以更少compute达到更好结果。 论文中可诚实报告：KL确实compute-efficient（fewer total FLOPs to reach good quality）， 但\\\"KL eliminates compensation\\\"的claim仍然不成立。\\n\\nBCE extended training从28.16降至24.80——额外1333步仅带来3.36 PPL改善。 BCE的收敛曲线在~800步后进入plateau，更多步数的边际收益递减。 这是因为BCE的per-neuron factorized gradient本身信息不足： 无论训练多久，BCE无法学到neuron间的joint interaction。 但这个结果不支持\\\"KL需要更多compute所以不公平\\\"的reviewer concern—— 即使给BCE等量compute，差距仍然巨大（24.80 vs 9.80）。 然而结合plan_001，真正的解决方案不是更多BCE training， 而是加compensation（9.40）——这才是compute的正确使用方式。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SPON reimplementation & reproduction\",\n    \"description\": \"在Llama 3.1 8B上重现SPON（static learnable bias + KL training）。 5个QA benchmarks验证reproduction质量。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"spon_wikitext2_ppl\": 10.82,\n      \"spon_model_sparsity\": 0.5,\n      \"spon_params_per_layer\": 4096,\n      \"spon_total_params\": 131072,\n      \"spon_training_time_min\": 15,\n      \"spon_arc_c\": 50.2,\n      \"spon_arc_e\": 77.5,\n      \"spon_boolq\": 79.8,\n      \"spon_piqa\": 78.1,\n      \"spon_winogrande\": 73.6,\n      \"published_arc_c\": 50.8,\n      \"published_arc_e\": 78.2,\n      \"published_boolq\": 80.5,\n      \"published_piqa\": 78.8,\n      \"published_winogrande\": 74.2,\n      \"reproduction_max_gap\": 1.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 4: SPON reproduction on 5 QA benchmarks\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Benchmark | Published | Ours | Δ\",\n          \"ARC-c | 50.8 | 50.2 | -0.6\",\n          \"ARC-e | 78.2 | 77.5 | -0.7\",\n          \"BoolQ | 80.5 | 79.8 | -0.7\",\n          \"PIQA | 78.8 | 78.1 | -0.7\",\n          \"WinoGrande | 74.2 | 73.6 | -0.6\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"SPON reproduction成功，5个benchmark最大偏差0.7 points。 PPL=10.82介于KL-only (9.80)和training-free (~12.5)之间， 符合static correction的预期能力范围。\\n\\nSPON方法简单（每层仅hidden_dim个learnable参数），超参数空间小， reproduction误差主要来自KL训练的随机性和calibration data差异。 所有5个benchmark与published results差距 < 1 point，reproduction合格。 PPL=10.82确认static correction的天花板：input-independent bias只能修正 average-case drift，无法适应per-input neuron importance变化。 这为plan_005的composition实验提供了valid SPON baseline。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SPON + KL predictor composition & additivity test\",\n    \"description\": \"同时应用SPON bias correction + KL contextual prediction。 Output-space linearity测试和per-layer正交性分析。3 seeds。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"spon_kl_s42_ppl\": 9.55,\n      \"spon_kl_s123_ppl\": 9.78,\n      \"spon_kl_s456_ppl\": 10.05,\n      \"spon_kl_mean_ppl\": 9.79,\n      \"spon_kl_std_ppl\": 0.25,\n      \"spon_only_ppl\": 10.82,\n      \"kl_only_mean_ppl\": 9.8,\n      \"teal_baseline_ppl\": 12.5,\n      \"spon_improvement_over_teal\": 1.68,\n      \"kl_improvement_over_teal\": 2.7,\n      \"predicted_additive_ppl\": 8.12,\n      \"actual_combined_ppl\": 9.79,\n      \"additivity_residual_ppl\": 1.67,\n      \"additivity_ratio\": 0.62,\n      \"logit_residual_norm_ratio\": 0.38,\n      \"mean_cos_similarity\": 0.34,\n      \"layers_with_cos_gt_03\": 20,\n      \"max_cos_similarity_layer\": 0.62\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 5: SPON + KL composition results\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Condition | PPL | Improvement over TEAL\",\n          \"TEAL baseline | 12.50 | —\",\n          \"SPON only | 10.82 | 1.68\",\n          \"KL only | 9.80 | 2.70\",\n          \"SPON+KL (actual) | 9.79 | 2.71\",\n          \"SPON+KL (additive prediction) | 8.12 | 4.38\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 5b: Additivity metrics\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Metric | Value\",\n          \"Additivity ratio | 0.62\",\n          \"Logit residual norm ratio | 0.38\",\n          \"Mean cos(c_s, c_θ) | 0.34\",\n          \"Layers with cos > 0.3 | 20/32\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"SPON+KL composition不满足可加性假设（Claim 2不成立）。 但这本身是一个有价值的empirical finding—— \\\"static和contextual corrections的overlap分析\\\"可作为standalone贡献。 论文中不再claim可加性，改为report interaction structure： \\\"static和contextual corrections在中间层高度相关， suggesting both target the same error mode (average-case neuron importance drift)\\\"。 这支持characterization study的叙事方向。\\n\\nSPON+KL (9.79) ≈ KL-only (9.80)——组合几乎没有额外收益。 predicted additive PPL=8.12 vs actual=9.79，additivity ratio仅0.62。 原因：SPON的static bias和KL predictor的contextual correction在output space 高度相关——两者都在修正同一组\\\"容易误杀\\\"的neurons的drift。 cos similarity分析确认：在中间层（layer 12-20），两种correction方向高度一致 （cos > 0.4），说明它们修正的是同一类误差而非互补的不同误差源。 Claim 2（可加性）在worst tier下彻底不成立。 logit_residual_norm_ratio=0.38 >> 0（如果可加应接近0）， interaction term不可忽略。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Training-free baselines @ 50% sparsity\",\n    \"description\": \"TEAL (activation magnitude + greedy allocation), WINA (weight-informed scoring), R-Sparse (rank-aware scoring)。建立三层比较：training-free < static-learned < contextual-learned。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"teal_vanilla_ppl\": 12.48,\n      \"wina_ppl\": 15.8,\n      \"rsparse_ppl\": 14.2,\n      \"dense_ppl\": 6.12,\n      \"teal_vanilla_sparsity\": 0.5,\n      \"wina_sparsity\": 0.5,\n      \"rsparse_sparsity\": 0.5,\n      \"teal_vs_dense_pct\": 103.9,\n      \"wina_vs_dense_pct\": 158.2,\n      \"rsparse_vs_dense_pct\": 132.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 6: Training-free baselines @ 50% sparsity\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Method | WikiText-2 PPL | Δ vs Dense (%)\",\n          \"Dense | 6.12 | —\",\n          \"TEAL (activation magnitude) | 12.48 | +103.9%\",\n          \"R-Sparse | 14.20 | +132.0%\",\n          \"WINA | 15.80 | +158.2%\",\n          \"SPON (static learned) | 10.82 | +76.8%\",\n          \"KL-only (contextual) | 9.80 | +60.1%\",\n          \"BCE+comp (contextual) | 9.40 | +53.6%\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"三层层级结构清晰，training-free到contextual有6-7 PPL points的gap。 这验证了learned prediction的价值。在worst tier下， KL-only和BCE+comp处于同一tier（contextual），彼此差距不显著。 paper的taxonomy贡献成立：不同training signal在不同granularity下的表现分布 本身就是有价值的empirical map。\\n\\nTEAL表现最好（12.48），因为activation magnitude是neuron importance的直接proxy， 加上greedy per-layer allocation自适应地保护关键层。 R-Sparse (14.20)次之——rank-aware scoring考虑了相对重要性但无跨层allocation。 WINA最差（15.80）——weight-informed scoring在SwiGLU gate×up结构下信号较弱， weight magnitude与activation importance的相关性不如直接用activation。 这建立了清晰的tier结构：training-free（12-16）<< SPON（10.8）<< contextual（9.4-9.8）。 注意这里的TEAL使用vanilla activation magnitude（非predictor scores）， 与registry中基于predictor scores的\\\"teal_sparse_ppl\\\"不同。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Full benchmark suite + wall-clock profiling\",\n    \"description\": \"所有条件在Llama 3.1 8B上的完整评估：WikiText-2, C4, ARC-c, WinoGrande, MMLU, GSM8K, HumanEval。Wall-clock profiling和Pareto frontier。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dense_wikitext2\": 6.12,\n      \"dense_c4\": 8.85,\n      \"dense_arc_c\": 53.2,\n      \"dense_winogrande\": 76.4,\n      \"dense_mmlu\": 65.8,\n      \"dense_gsm8k\": 52.1,\n      \"dense_humaneval\": 31.7,\n      \"kl_wikitext2\": 9.8,\n      \"kl_c4\": 12.65,\n      \"kl_arc_c\": 48.2,\n      \"kl_winogrande\": 69.8,\n      \"kl_mmlu\": 60.1,\n      \"kl_gsm8k\": 44.5,\n      \"kl_humaneval\": 25.0,\n      \"kl_mean_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct\": 8.9,\n      \"bce_comp_wikitext2\": 9.4,\n      \"bce_comp_c4\": 12.15,\n      \"bce_comp_arc_c\": 49.5,\n      \"bce_comp_winogrande\": 71.2,\n      \"bce_comp_mmlu\": 61.5,\n      \"bce_comp_gsm8k\": 46.0,\n      \"bce_comp_humaneval\": 26.5,\n      \"bce_comp_mean_acc_drop_vs_dense_pct\": 7.4,\n      \"spon_wikitext2\": 10.82,\n      \"spon_c4\": 14.0,\n      \"spon_arc_c\": 46.5,\n      \"spon_winogrande\": 67.0,\n      \"spon_mmlu\": 57.8,\n      \"spon_gsm8k\": 40.2,\n      \"spon_humaneval\": 21.0,\n      \"spon_kl_wikitext2\": 9.79,\n      \"spon_kl_arc_c\": 47.8,\n      \"spon_kl_mmlu\": 59.5,\n      \"teal_wikitext2\": 12.48,\n      \"teal_arc_c\": 41.5,\n      \"teal_mmlu\": 52.0,\n      \"dense_throughput\": 42.0,\n      \"kl_only_throughput\": 56.5,\n      \"bce_comp_throughput\": 49.8,\n      \"spon_kl_throughput\": 55.8,\n      \"teal_throughput\": 58.2,\n      \"kl_only_extra_mem_mb\": 48,\n      \"bce_comp_extra_mem_mb\": 304\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 7: Full benchmark results (Llama 3.1 8B, 50% sparsity)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Method | Wiki-2↓ | C4↓ | ARC-c↑ | WinoG↑ | MMLU↑ | GSM8K↑ | HumanE↑ | Avg Δ%\",\n          \"Dense | 6.12 | 8.85 | 53.2 | 76.4 | 65.8 | 52.1 | 31.7 | —\",\n          \"TEAL | 12.48 | 16.50 | 41.5 | 62.0 | 52.0 | 30.5 | 15.0 | -24.8\",\n          \"SPON | 10.82 | 14.00 | 46.5 | 67.0 | 57.8 | 40.2 | 21.0 | -14.5\",\n          \"KL-only | 9.80 | 12.65 | 48.2 | 69.8 | 60.1 | 44.5 | 25.0 | -8.9\",\n          \"BCE+comp | 9.40 | 12.15 | 49.5 | 71.2 | 61.5 | 46.0 | 26.5 | -7.4\",\n          \"KL+comp | 8.95 | 11.60 | 50.8 | 72.5 | 62.8 | 48.0 | 28.0 | -5.5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 7b: Inference profiling\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Method | Throughput (tok/s) | Speedup | Extra Memory (MB)\",\n          \"Dense | 42.0 | 1.00x | 0\",\n          \"TEAL | 58.2 | 1.39x | 0\",\n          \"SPON | 57.0 | 1.36x | 0 (absorbed)\",\n          \"KL-only | 56.5 | 1.35x | 48\",\n          \"SPON+KL | 55.8 | 1.33x | 48\",\n          \"BCE+comp | 49.8 | 1.19x | 304\",\n          \"KL+comp | 49.2 | 1.17x | 304\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Full evaluation确认worst tier叙事：BCE+comp全面优于KL-only（quality）， KL-only优势仅在inference efficiency。Pareto分析显示两种方法在 quality-efficiency tradeoff空间占据不同的niche，不存在一方dominance。 KL+comp是global best quality但最慢——说明最优方案是KL+comp而非KL alone。 Paper的Pareto frontier图本身就是有价值的contribution， 展示了training signal × compensation × granularity的完整landscape。\\n\\nBCE+comp在6/7个benchmark上优于KL-only（唯一例外HumanEval仅差1.5 points）。 Mean accuracy drop: BCE+comp 7.4% vs KL-only 8.9%——差距一致且显著。 原因：compensation MLP通过per-layer修正补偿了BCE predictor的误差， 提供了比KL更均匀的quality recovery。KL在某些任务（GSM8K -14.6%） 降幅显著——多步推理任务对sparse noise更敏感，KL的layer-adaptive sparsity 并未给reasoning带来额外保护。\\nWall-clock方面，KL-only (1.35x) > BCE+comp (1.19x)： KL唯一的结构性优势是不需要compensation MLP，inference更轻量。 但0.16x的speedup差距（大致4ms/token on batch=1） 在多数deployment场景中不是决定性差异。 BCE+comp的304MB extra memory vs KL的48MB是更显著的差异—— 在memory-constrained edge deployment中KL有优势。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"7-level sparsity sweep: KL vs BCE s² scaling test\",\n    \"description\": \"30/35/40/45/50/55/60% sparsity sweep, KL-only vs BCE-only。 测试Claim 3: KL-BCE delta ~ s²。1 seed per level。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"kl_ppl_30\": 6.55,\n      \"kl_ppl_35\": 6.85,\n      \"kl_ppl_40\": 7.8,\n      \"kl_ppl_45\": 8.6,\n      \"kl_ppl_50\": 9.8,\n      \"kl_ppl_55\": 16.0,\n      \"kl_ppl_60\": 32.0,\n      \"bce_ppl_30\": 7.5,\n      \"bce_ppl_35\": 11.5,\n      \"bce_ppl_40\": 9.8,\n      \"bce_ppl_45\": 14.5,\n      \"bce_ppl_50\": 28.0,\n      \"bce_ppl_55\": 30.0,\n      \"bce_ppl_60\": 45.0,\n      \"delta_30\": 0.95,\n      \"delta_35\": 4.65,\n      \"delta_40\": 2.0,\n      \"delta_45\": 5.9,\n      \"delta_50\": 18.2,\n      \"delta_55\": 14.0,\n      \"delta_60\": 13.0,\n      \"r2_delta_vs_s2\": 0.66,\n      \"r2_delta_vs_s_linear\": 0.68,\n      \"r2_delta_vs_s2_excluding_high\": 0.81,\n      \"quadratic_coeff_a\": 74.9,\n      \"taylor_second_order_error_50pct\": 0.28,\n      \"taylor_second_order_error_60pct\": 0.55\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 8a: Sparsity sweep results\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Sparsity | s² | KL PPL | BCE PPL | Δ(BCE−KL)\",\n          \"30% | 0.090 | 6.55 | 7.50 | 0.95\",\n          \"35% | 0.122 | 6.85 | 11.50 | 4.65\",\n          \"40% | 0.160 | 7.80 | 9.80 | 2.00\",\n          \"45% | 0.202 | 8.60 | 14.50 | 5.90\",\n          \"50% | 0.250 | 9.80 | 28.00 | 18.20\",\n          \"55% | 0.302 | 16.00 | 30.00 | 14.00\",\n          \"60% | 0.360 | 32.00 | 45.00 | 13.00\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 8b: Scaling law fit comparison\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Model | R² (all points) | R² (s≤0.50)\",\n          \"Δ ~ a·s² + b | 0.66 | 0.81\",\n          \"Δ ~ a·s + b | 0.68 | 0.82\",\n          \"Δ ~ a·exp(b·s) | 0.72 | 0.78\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Claim 3（s² scaling）不成立。数据呈现phase-transition而非smooth polynomial关系： BCE在s≈0.45-0.50有一个\\\"catastrophic transition\\\"（PPL从14.5跳到28）， 之后plateau；KL在s≈0.55有类似transition（8.6→16）但更晚。 两个transition point的差异——而非smooth quadratic——才是delta的真正驱动力。 论文中不应claim s² scaling law，改为报告\\\"BCE exits graceful degradation at lower sparsity than KL（~45% vs ~55%），resulting in a phase-transition rather than polynomial relationship in the KL-BCE gap\\\"。\\n\\nDelta呈非单调pattern——在s=0.40处下降（2.00 < 4.65 at s=0.35）， 在s=0.55-0.60处plateau/下降（14.00→13.00）。 s=0.40异常原因：BCE在某些sparsity level恰好命中\\\"easy\\\"的neuron pruning pattern， 偶尔表现好于趋势。s=0.55-0.60下降原因：KL本身开始collapse（16→32 PPL）， 两种方法都在高sparsity下崩溃，delta反而缩小。\\nR²(Δ~s²) = 0.66, R²(Δ~s) = 0.68——linear fit甚至略好于quadratic， s²理论叙事不成立。限制在s≤0.50范围内R²=0.81略好， 但这是cherry-picking range来fit理论。\\nTaylor expansion在s=0.50已有28%相对误差，在s=0.60达55%。 O(s²D²) scaling argument的前提是Taylor展开有效—— 高sparsity下高阶项不可忽略，理论prediction失效。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 generalization validation\",\n    \"description\": \"Mistral-7B-v0.3上KL-only vs BCE+comp @ 50%。 Core benchmarks: WikiText-2, ARC-c, MMLU。3 seeds each。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"mistral_dense_ppl\": 7.82,\n      \"mistral_kl_s42_ppl\": 14.1,\n      \"mistral_kl_s123_ppl\": 14.85,\n      \"mistral_kl_s456_ppl\": 13.5,\n      \"mistral_kl_mean_ppl\": 14.15,\n      \"mistral_kl_std_ppl\": 0.68,\n      \"mistral_kl_ppl_increase_pct\": 80.9,\n      \"mistral_kl_arc_c\": 41.5,\n      \"mistral_kl_mmlu\": 51.8,\n      \"mistral_bce_comp_s42_ppl\": 12.5,\n      \"mistral_bce_comp_s123_ppl\": 12.8,\n      \"mistral_bce_comp_s456_ppl\": 13.1,\n      \"mistral_bce_comp_mean_ppl\": 12.8,\n      \"mistral_bce_comp_std_ppl\": 0.3,\n      \"mistral_bce_comp_ppl_increase_pct\": 63.7,\n      \"mistral_bce_comp_arc_c\": 44.8,\n      \"mistral_bce_comp_mmlu\": 55.2,\n      \"mistral_kl_vs_bce_comp_gap\": 1.35,\n      \"mistral_dense_arc_c\": 49.5,\n      \"mistral_dense_mmlu\": 62.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 9: Mistral-7B-v0.3 results @ 50% sparsity\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Method | PPL | Δ vs Dense (%) | ARC-c | MMLU\",\n          \"Dense | 7.82 | — | 49.5 | 62.0\",\n          \"KL-only | 14.15±0.68 | +80.9 | 41.5 | 51.8\",\n          \"BCE+comp | 12.80±0.30 | +63.7 | 44.8 | 55.2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 9b: Cross-architecture comparison\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Architecture | KL-only PPL Δ% | BCE+comp PPL Δ% | KL−BCE_comp gap\",\n          \"Llama 3.1 8B | +60.1 | +53.6 | +0.40\",\n          \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 | +80.9 | +63.7 | +1.35\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Mistral结果是worst tier的strongest evidence。 不仅KL不优于BCE+comp，差距还在第二个architecture上放大了。 这说明KL的\\\"优势\\\"（如果存在）是architecture-dependent的， 不具备generalize条件。论文中必须诚实报告cross-architecture inconsistency， 并在characterization framework下解释： \\\"KL-only的effectiveness取决于output distribution的per-layer stability， 而这是architecture-dependent的property\\\"。\\n\\nMistral-7B-v0.3使用GQA + sliding window attention， KV cache结构与Llama 3.1不同（GQA → 更少的KV heads，信息更集中）。 KL训练依赖full output distribution匹配——Mistral的sliding window 导致不同position的logit distribution变化更剧烈， KL predictor更难学习稳定的mask pattern。\\nBCE+comp在Mistral上表现更好（12.80 vs 14.15）， gap进一步扩大到+1.35（Llama上是+0.40）。 compensation MLP通过直接修正sparse output对architecture更鲁棒， 不依赖output distribution的稳定性。\\nKL PPL increase 80.9%在target range [60, 120]内。 这彻底否定了KL优势的generalizability—— 在第二个architecture上，方向反转且差距更大。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LongBench English subset evaluation (4K-32K)\",\n    \"description\": \"全条件在LongBench English subset上评估。 Per-task-type breakdown: single-doc QA, multi-doc QA, summarization, few-shot, code。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dense_single_doc_qa\": 22.0,\n      \"dense_multi_doc_qa\": 35.0,\n      \"dense_summarization\": 28.0,\n      \"dense_few_shot\": 68.0,\n      \"dense_code\": 55.0,\n      \"kl_single_doc_qa\": 17.2,\n      \"kl_multi_doc_qa\": 26.5,\n      \"kl_summarization\": 21.5,\n      \"kl_few_shot\": 59.5,\n      \"kl_code\": 46.0,\n      \"kl_longbench_avg_drop_pct\": 18.5,\n      \"bce_comp_single_doc_qa\": 18.5,\n      \"bce_comp_multi_doc_qa\": 28.8,\n      \"bce_comp_summarization\": 23.2,\n      \"bce_comp_few_shot\": 61.0,\n      \"bce_comp_code\": 47.5,\n      \"bce_comp_longbench_avg_drop_pct\": 14.2,\n      \"spon_kl_single_doc_qa\": 17.8,\n      \"spon_kl_multi_doc_qa\": 27.0,\n      \"spon_kl_few_shot\": 60.0,\n      \"teal_single_doc_qa\": 13.5,\n      \"teal_multi_doc_qa\": 20.0,\n      \"teal_few_shot\": 50.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 10: LongBench per-task-type results\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Task Type | Dense | KL-only | BCE+comp | SPON+KL | TEAL\",\n          \"Single-doc QA | 22.0 | 17.2 | 18.5 | 17.8 | 13.5\",\n          \"Multi-doc QA | 35.0 | 26.5 | 28.8 | 27.0 | 20.0\",\n          \"Summarization | 28.0 | 21.5 | 23.2 | 22.0 | 16.5\",\n          \"Few-shot | 68.0 | 59.5 | 61.0 | 60.0 | 50.0\",\n          \"Code | 55.0 | 46.0 | 47.5 | 46.5 | 38.0\",\n          \"Avg Drop % | — | -18.5 | -14.2 | -16.8 | -32.5\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Long context进一步支持worst tier叙事—— KL-only的degradation在long context下比short context更严重 （avg drop 18.5% vs short-context benchmarks的8.9%）。 BCE+comp更鲁棒（14.2% vs 18.5%），compensation提供了error buffering。 这对NLP venue特别重要——long-context capability是EMNLP reviewer关注的重点。\\n\\n长文本任务放大了sparse prediction的错误累积效应。 KL predictor在训练时用512-token sequences—— 长context下distribution shift导致predictor的mask decisions drift， 错误在long-range dependencies中逐步放大。\\nBCE+comp的compensation MLP提供了per-layer error correction， 对distribution shift更鲁棒——即使mask不完美，compensation能部分修正。 Multi-doc QA差距最大（26.5 vs 28.8，8.7% gap）， 因为multi-doc需要跨文档信息整合，sparse noise影响cross-document attention。\\nSPON+KL (17.8 single-doc) 仅略优于KL-only (17.2)， 再次确认SPON+KL的非可加性——在long context下也如此。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"MT-Bench evaluation (GPT-4o judge)\",\n    \"description\": \"80个multi-turn questions, 8个categories。GPT-4o作为judge。 测试instruction-following quality under sparsity。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dense_mt_bench_avg\": 7.2,\n      \"kl_mt_bench_avg\": 5.95,\n      \"bce_comp_mt_bench_avg\": 6.3,\n      \"spon_kl_mt_bench_avg\": 6.05,\n      \"teal_mt_bench_avg\": 4.8,\n      \"kl_writing\": 6.5,\n      \"kl_reasoning\": 5.2,\n      \"kl_math\": 4.8,\n      \"kl_coding\": 5.5,\n      \"bce_comp_writing\": 6.8,\n      \"bce_comp_reasoning\": 5.8,\n      \"bce_comp_math\": 5.2,\n      \"bce_comp_coding\": 5.9\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 11: MT-Bench scores (GPT-4o judge)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Method | Avg | Writing | Reasoning | Math | Coding | Roleplay | Extraction | STEM | Humanities\",\n          \"Dense | 7.20 | 7.8 | 6.8 | 6.5 | 7.0 | 7.5 | 7.2 | 7.0 | 7.8\",\n          \"KL-only | 5.95 | 6.5 | 5.2 | 4.8 | 5.5 | 6.5 | 6.0 | 5.8 | 6.3\",\n          \"BCE+comp | 6.30 | 6.8 | 5.8 | 5.2 | 5.9 | 6.8 | 6.2 | 6.2 | 6.5\",\n          \"SPON+KL | 6.05 | 6.6 | 5.3 | 4.9 | 5.6 | 6.5 | 6.1 | 5.9 | 6.5\",\n          \"TEAL | 4.80 | 5.2 | 4.0 | 3.5 | 4.5 | 5.5 | 4.8 | 4.5 | 5.0\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"MT-Bench确认了downstream quality ordering: BCE+comp > KL-only。 在NLP-relevant的instruction-following setting下， compensation的error correction在multi-turn中有cumulative benefit。 对EMNLP submission有利——MT-Bench直接评估NLP应用质量。\\n\\nMT-Bench是multi-turn对话质量的综合测试。 KL-only (5.95) vs BCE+comp (6.30)——差距0.35分在MT-Bench scale上有意义。 Reasoning和math categories差距最大（0.6和0.4分）， 因为多步推理对intermediate representation的准确性要求高， sparse noise在turn间累积。 Compensation MLP提供的error correction在multi-turn setting下尤其有价值， 每个turn的correction防止error向后续turns propagation。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"RULER synthetic long-context evaluation\",\n    \"description\": \"RULER (4K, 16K) × 3 task types: NIAH-Single, NIAH-MultiKey, Variable Tracking。 Fine-grained capability diagnostics。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dense_niah_s_4k\": 98.0,\n      \"dense_niah_s_16k\": 92.0,\n      \"dense_niah_mk_4k\": 85.0,\n      \"dense_niah_mk_16k\": 70.0,\n      \"dense_vt_4k\": 80.0,\n      \"dense_vt_16k\": 62.0,\n      \"kl_niah_s_4k\": 88.0,\n      \"kl_niah_s_16k\": 70.0,\n      \"kl_niah_mk_4k\": 71.0,\n      \"kl_niah_mk_16k\": 45.0,\n      \"kl_vt_4k\": 64.0,\n      \"kl_vt_16k\": 35.0,\n      \"bce_comp_niah_s_4k\": 91.0,\n      \"bce_comp_niah_s_16k\": 76.0,\n      \"bce_comp_niah_mk_4k\": 75.0,\n      \"bce_comp_niah_mk_16k\": 52.0,\n      \"bce_comp_vt_4k\": 68.0,\n      \"bce_comp_vt_16k\": 42.0,\n      \"kl_16k_avg_drop_vs_dense\": 31.3,\n      \"bce_comp_16k_avg_drop_vs_dense\": 23.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table 12: RULER results (accuracy %)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          \"Task | Context | Dense | KL-only | BCE+comp | Δ(KL vs BCE+comp)\",\n          \"NIAH-S | 4K | 98.0 | 88.0 | 91.0 | -3.0\",\n          \"NIAH-S | 16K | 92.0 | 70.0 | 76.0 | -6.0\",\n          \"NIAH-MK | 4K | 85.0 | 71.0 | 75.0 | -4.0\",\n          \"NIAH-MK | 16K | 70.0 | 45.0 | 52.0 | -7.0\",\n          \"VT | 4K | 80.0 | 64.0 | 68.0 | -4.0\",\n          \"VT | 16K | 62.0 | 35.0 | 42.0 | -7.0\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"RULER的controlled diagnostics是worst tier的fine-grained evidence。 KL-only在长序列上的capability loss pattern清晰且一致， 作为EMNLP paper的补充diagnostics有说服力。 但RULER本身是P2 priority——如果时间不足， LongBench (plan_010)已经cover了long-context方向， RULER提供的是complementary validation而非必要条件。\\n\\nRULER的synthetic tasks提供了controlled capability measurement。 16K context下KL-only降幅最大——NIAH-MultiKey从85→45（-47.1%）， Variable Tracking从62→35（-43.5%）。 这些任务需要精确的long-range retrieval和state tracking， sparse noise在16K tokens范围内严重干扰attention pattern。\\nBCE+comp在所有6个setting上优于KL-only， 16K的NIAH-MultiKey差距7 points（52 vs 45），VT差距7 points（42 vs 35）。 Compensation的per-layer correction在长序列下提供了持续的error mitigation。\\nKL在4K→16K的degradation slope比BCE+comp更陡， 说明KL predictor的mask decision在序列长度增加时快速恶化—— 进一步支持\\\"KL的训练信号不够robust\\\"的worst-tier叙事。\"\n  }\n]","numLines":543,"startLine":1,"totalLines":543}}}
